                The grammar for the replacement field is as follows:
            
              > {[<index>][:<spec>]}
            
                The <index> is an optional integer value that refers to the position
                of the argument after the format string. If the <index> is omitted
                for all replacement fields, they are automatically substituted with
                0, 1, 2, .... It is not permitted to mix indexed and non-indexed
                replacement fields.
            
